  "description": "Language-agnostic laws of the brep.transform widgets. Shape outputs state the analytic kind, volume, area and bounds of the moved shape and, for the box motions, the row-major 4x4 matrix that maps the pinned input tessellation (inputMeshes.shape) onto the pinned output tessellation; the TypeScript oracle applies the matrix with three's Matrix4 and compares the welded corner sets. Patterns of disjoint or overlapping solids fuse into one solid.",
